  "description": "The protagonist, %%, graduated from college with a degree in chemistry, but struggled with repeated job failures. But then, an advertisement for the civil service exam appeared before his eyes. Passing in just eight months. Guaranteed retirement and a pension. And with all the benefits and the respect of those around him. For %%, the Grade 9 civil service job seemed like the perfect fit. The low pay, the high competition, and the challenging exam didn't matter to him. And so, %% embarked on the civil service exam.\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
